0 44 594 [
[(Here again is a [line~] controlling the amplitude of an [osc~],)]
[(but with the outputs graphed. Click the message boxes above to)]
[(try it. Note that in the first two boxes, the [line~] objects)]
[(get two messages. The first one, with no time value, causes the)]
[([line~] to jump immediately to the value. The third box takes)]
[([line~]'s previous value as a point of departure. What you see)]
[(will depend on which box you last clicked and how long you)]
[(waited between the two.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
