/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 39 103 [
[(On very old machines you may hear an interruption)]
[(in the sound one second after you click on the)]
[(first or third box. This is because the graphical)]
[(updates are likely to eat more CPU time than your)]
[(audio buffer has pre-buffered for.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
